                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Electronics for Every Day</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Discover smartphones, laptops, audio, smart home and more for work, play and everyday life</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Find Your Everyday Tech</h2>\n<p>Explore electronics designed to make work, entertainment and daily routines easier. From connected devices to handy accessories, find options for different needs and budgets.</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Smartphones, laptops and tablets</li>\n    <li>Headphones, TVs and gaming gear</li>\n    <li>Smart home devices and useful accessories</li>\n</ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-teaser",
              "position": 2,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Make More of Every Moment</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><i>Find the tech to stay connected, get things done and enjoy your downtime</i></p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 3,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Tech for Work</h3>\n<p>Choose laptops, monitors and accessories to support your setup, whether you’re working from home, studying or staying productive on the go.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Tech for Play</h3>\n<p>Bring entertainment closer with headphones, TVs and gaming gear. Explore devices and accessories to suit your space, style and budget.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "html",
              "position": 4,
              "slots": []
            }
          ]
        }
