                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Tech That Fits Your Routine</h2>\n<p>Find smartphones, laptops and accessories designed to help you stay connected, productive and ready for whatever the day brings.</p>\n<p>From compact essentials to feature-rich upgrades, discover options for different needs and budgets.</p>"
