              "type": "image-text",
              "position": 2,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Entertainment Your Way</h2>\n<p>Build a setup that suits your space, with TVs, headphones and gaming gear for immersive entertainment at home or on the go.</p>\n<p>Explore trusted everyday devices and fresh additions to your tech lineup.</p>"
