                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "center",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Smarter Everyday Living</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Discover smart home devices and practical electronics that bring convenience, connection and comfort to your daily routine.</p>"
