              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 2.5em; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Electronics Overview</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 1.2em; color: #666; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">Explore electronics for work, play and everyday life, from smartphones and laptops to smart home devices and practical accessories.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Explore Electronics</h2>\n<p>Discover a range of consumer electronics and accessories for different needs. Explore popular categories and find the right tech for everyday life:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Computers</strong> - Laptops and accessories for work and study</li>\n<li><strong>Smartphones</strong> - Mobile devices and everyday essentials</li>\n<li><strong>Audio</strong> - Headphones and speakers for listening anywhere</li>\n<li><strong>TVs</strong> - Screens for movies, shows and home entertainment</li>\n<li><strong>Smart Home</strong> - Connected devices for added convenience</li>\n<li><strong>Gaming</strong> - Gear and accessories for play</li>\n</ul>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Find the Right Tech</h2>\n<p>Browse electronics with features and options to suit a variety of preferences and budgets:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Everyday Essentials</strong> - Practical devices for daily tasks</li>\n<li><strong>Work & Study</strong> - Laptops and accessories to support productivity</li>\n<li><strong>Entertainment</strong> - Audio, TVs and gaming gear for downtime</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 16px; color: #666;\">Browse each category to explore devices and accessories for your needs.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
